# Play Store upload signing — keystore.properties is machine-local; the upload
# keystore itself lives gitignored in "12. Jeevan App/release/". See CONTEXT.md 0-OPS #8.
# 2026-08-12: renamed to keystore.properties.play-upload-disabled in both
# apps/{user,driver}-app/android/ so a plain assembleRelease can't silently
# pick it up and sign trial sideload builds with the wrong key (0-OPS #10,
# the v2.1.1 incident). Same real credentials, still must never be committed.
keystore.properties
keystore.properties.*
jr-upload.keystore
*.jks
